<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GOLF-WORLD CUP COLLATED SECOND ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-WORLD CUP COLLATED SECOND ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SOMERSET WEST, South Africa 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collated</p>
<p>second round scores at the World Cup of Golf on Friday:</p>
<p>280 South Africa (Ernie Els 68 72, Wayne Westner 68,</p>
<p>72)</p>
<p>281 Scotland (Andrew Coltart 70 72, Paul Lawrie 69 70)</p>
<p>285 Denmark (Thomas Bjorn 67 74, Rene Budde 71 73),</p>
<p>France (Jean van de Velde 73 68, Marc-Antonie Farry</p>
<p>71 73)</p>
